        "type": "p",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "text": "Hello Alex,"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "text": "Spring is here, and so is our plant swap. Bring cuttings, seeds and spare pots, and take home something new. We will also have a short talk on composting for small gardens."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "text": "The swap is on Saturday 14 March, from 10:00 to 13:00, at the community hall."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "button",
        "text": "See what's on offer",
        "link": 1,
        "bg": "#2e7d32",
        "color": "#ffffff"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "text": "See you there,\nRobin, club secretary"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "hr"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "align": "center",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "text": "You are receiving this because you signed up at the spring fair. ",
            "color": "#666666"
